Irisbeat 0.1.0
Irisbeat's own code is open source under AGPL-3.0-only. See LICENSE.

Corresponding Source is distributed as irisbeat-0.1.0-source.tar.gz alongside
irisbeat-0.1.0.tgz, SHA256SUMS and release.json. release.json identifies the exact
Git revision and source archive integrity. Source includes application code,
installation/build scripts, configuration, tests and the dependency lockfile.
Network users can use the Source link on public and operator pages. Operators
serving modified versions must provide their version's Corresponding Source and
update that link in src/ui.ts before building; see docs/install.md.

No third-party runtime library code is vendored in the source engine package.
Cloudflare's Workers runtime is supplied by the platform, not distributed here.
Development/build dependencies retain their respective licenses and notices in
the packages installed by npm ci. Preserve those notices if redistributing them.
